  "slug": "room-block-order-form",
  "title": "Room Block Order Form",
  "subtitle": "The confirmed block order: inventory by night and room type, rate, cutoff, reservation method, billing routing, and release terms.",
  "description": "An original room block order. It records block identity and group routing, the confirmed inventory by night and room type with rates, the reservation and billing method with cutoff and release terms, authorization, open conditions, and distribution to reservations, front office, and accounting.",
  "use_case": "Use as the operating record for one contracted guest-room block, from confirmation through cutoff to release. The order closes when reservations, front office, and accounting have acknowledged the current revision.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
