                "Declined"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "term_confirmations",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Term confirmations",
          "items": [
            "Rate confirmed against the signed agreement",
            "Cutoff and release dates loaded in the reservation system",
            "Booking link or block code tested before release to the group",
            "Accessible room commitment recorded against specific room types",
            "Complimentary room basis recorded and agreed with accounting",
            "Billing route confirmed with accounting before arrival",
            "Early arrival and late departure handling recorded",
            "Incidental charge authorization approach recorded"
          ],
          "guidance": "Record the routing only. Guest payment card details are held in the reservation system, never on this order."
        }
      ]
    },
